Almost certainly you're not getting a good DCOK.  Most likely culprit
is that the cable that brings DCOK to the backplane fell off.  Look, IIRC,
for a 10-conductor ribbon cable between the power supply/front panel and
backplane.

It's also possible, of course, that you've got a problem with power
supply or CPU.  But I think a cable fell off.

