snipped), I suspect the batteries. I don't know whether a faulty battery can
prevent the controller from booting, but it seems possible.

If not that, then it would seem that you have the same fault on both
controllers, which seems somewhat unlikely. (Unless, as I have suggested
before) a faulty terminal has been connected to each controller in turn and
damaged it.)

