>> Typically one would expect a secondary message that provides the reason
>> that the foreign transport activation failed. I'm not familiar with the
>> IDX mail-hook but I'd guess that you're either missing the IDX_MAILSHR
>> image from SYS$SHARE, or missing a logical name that defines an alternate
>> location for IDX_MAILSHR.
