>     -RMS-E-FLK, file currently locked by another user

You should be able to 

$ pipe/nosymb/nologi show devi/file dsa0 | sear sys$pipe idx_mailshr

from a suitably privileged account and see what process has the
mailshr open. What action comes next probably depends upon why
the process has the file open for exclusive access - which seems
very strange for this sort of file.
